  <trk>
    <name>WALK 37. Eglinton extended</name>
    <desc>Walk, starting in Eglinton country park, following Garnock Water to NCP, along country roads back to Eglinton and walking round the periphery of the park to take in Coursehill Mount.</desc>
    <type>hikingTourTrail</type>
